cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GLYPHARIS in your work, please cite it with the metadata in this file.
  The model weights are not part of this software; their terms are in MODEL_CARD.md.
title: GLYPHARIS
type: software
authors:
  - alias: DuhItzAniket
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: https://github.com/DuhItzAniket/Glypharis
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A lightweight OCR engine for document images. It recovers readable text from scanned,
  photographed, degraded, or image-only document pages and returns it as structured output:
  lines, boxes, confidence, and timing. It is a two-stage pipeline: a text-line detector
  followed by a CTC line recognizer.
keywords:
  - OCR
  - optical character recognition
  - document images
  - text detection
  - text recognition
  - CTC
